# MCP Stripe — invariants (example)

⚠️ NEVER click or activate a REAL PAYMENT button on a customer portal (a "Pay now" button, a Stripe Link) — the action is IRREVERSIBLE, it notifies the customer immediately, and the public portal has no test mode.
⚠️ To check that an invoice or a link works, stop at READING it (page loaded, amount correct, button present) — never click the action itself.
Stripe 2FA is TOTP and is not stored, so always ask for the code live; never guess it and never work around it.
`sk_test_...` / `pk_test_...` keys are the sandbox and carry no real risk. `sk_live_...` / `pk_live_...` keys move real money — never print or log them in clear beyond what is strictly needed.
